              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ngo 2:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ni bo bana ba Shela mwene Yuda: Eri se wa Leka, na Layada se wa Maresha, kandi ni we yakomōtsweko n’imiryango y’abajishi b’impuzu zera derere, bo mu nzu ya Ashibeya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yokimu n’abantu b’i Kozeba, na Yowasi na Sarafu, ari bo bātwara i Mowabu, bo na Yashubilehemu; kand’ ayo majambo n’aya kera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni bo bār’ ababumvyi, baba i Netayimu n’i Gedera; bāba ngaho ku mwami, bamukorera igikorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
